es-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","review_id":"cByYNRxjFkTy-19nxlHNng","date":"2020-03-12T04:01:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9560220241546631,"text_excerpt":"I woke up with a gift card in my email from my friend and fellow Yelper to visit here. Boy, was I happy she sent me to Galatoire's. I really liked be old school style of how they treated us. White table cloth and servers wearing bow ties. It was super classy, plus the servers have worked there for years upon years upon years. Our particular server had been there for 17 years. My friend and I really did enjoy the elegance. I think she felt a little different about it than I did because this is not something that she was accustomed to doing. For me, I like dining at these types of places, yet, I usually prefer it to be for a special occasion such as this. It was our birthday trip. The décor..."},{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","review_id":"j7pFba3OUPPOq7WvoKqM_w","date":"2015-12-11T17:48:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.949813723564148,"text_excerpt":"Another restaurant I've had on my list to try for a while is Galatoire's. So when some work people put together a lunch there I had to RSVP yes...who turns down a free lunch anyway? First off, this place is fancy in an old school kind of way. This makes sense since it was founded in 1905 and is partially owned by 5th generation descendants of the Galatoire family. Tables are white tablecloth covered. Waiters are dressed up. Tons of older folks were eating there (like a lady celebrating her 80th birthday) and they were all dressed up...for lunch! I thought it was freaking adorable. So I'd stay stick to the business casual in this place. And at night men will need a jacket. They have a sele..."},{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","review_id":"QhxP0KvUG7CCNKCVaWtmzg","date":"2009-12-23T03:58:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9468393325805664,"text_excerpt":"There are many differing opinions out there on Galatoire's, so I decided to give it a try, and believe it or not, most (not all) of what you read is fairly accurate. What everything essentially boiled down to was experience. I'm not one to eat out fancy all the time so I figured the one time I felt like getting a fancy meal, why not make it one to remember? I'd searched and searched an it seems like for the type of New Orleans experience I wanted, Galatoire's would be the place. Let's start with food: not everything is as good as people would make you believe. Some of the dishes truly excel however. For starters, we had Oysters en Brochette, which were quite good though not amazing, Sweet..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","photo_id":"rUxGjqp8-hxpWsWIZSJezQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rUxGjqp8-hxpWsWIZSJezQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8896943926811218},{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","photo_id":"9W3zS_uYhaNMPCio_UDolw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9W3zS_uYhaNMPCio_UDolw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8538354635238647},{"business_id":"QA8QLpwf_YT9C2ST5YJ0vw","photo_id":"j5nNYM6dZIJX3fxo-WrfZA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/j5nNYM6dZIJX